ine--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">在日本各地的宝可梦商店宝可梦中心，生日月份可以领取宝可梦，还会为你庆祝！！<br>\n<br>\n开发《XY》时，我看到大家在宝可梦中心接受庆祝，突然灵光一闪！<br>\n<br>\n啊！不是给游戏机设置过生日吗！<br>\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">游戏里也能庆祝大家的诞生！<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n就这样诞生的就是</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这个！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9255050/001-a4ccb37a03.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9255050/001-a4ccb37a03.webp\" alt=\"_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_128APPLE_IMG_8812.JPG\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"576\" height=\"428\"></a></figure><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">我自己也体验了一下（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">总是为宝可梦恢复体力的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">宝可梦中心</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">生日当天去的话，就会得到庆祝！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">最开始构思的时候</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">我想象的只是配上音乐和留言之类的简单内容</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">不过</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">GAME FREAK 的工作人员</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">拿出了十足的干劲</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">把它做得相当华丽又可爱哦！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9255050/002-888db720b6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9255050/002-888db720b6.webp\" alt=\"_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_128APPLE_IMG_8813.JPG\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"576\" height=\"455\"></a></figure><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">《太阳／月亮》是这样的！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">日本这边</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">播放的是“生日快乐”的音乐</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">但有些国家播放的是</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">宝可梦中心的八音盒版本</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">过生日的人</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">我希望你们能亲眼看到</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">所以在游戏里的宝可梦中心</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">生日当天一定要</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">去看看哦——！！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">当然</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">生日月份去现实中的宝可梦中心</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">也别忘了哦！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">1月12日</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">マスダ誕生日でした！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">たくさんのお祝いメッセージやイラスト</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">みんなありがとう！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">とっても幸せな1日になりました！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">そして！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">誕生日と言えば</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ポケモンセンター！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">日本各地にあるポケモンショップポケモンセンターではお誕生月にポケモンをもらえたりお祝いしてくれます！！<br>\n<br>\nXY開発中にポケモンセンターでお祝いされてるみんなを見ていてふと閃いたんです！<br>\n<br>\nあ！ゲーム機に誕生日設定してるじゃん！<br>\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ゲーム内でもみんなが産まれたことをお祝いできる！<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nこうして誕生したのが</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">こちら！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9255050/001-a4ccb37a03.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9255050/001-a4ccb37a03.webp\" alt=\"_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_128APPLE_IMG_8812.JPG\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"576\" height=\"428\"></a></figure><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">自分でも体験(笑)</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">いつもポケモンを回復してくれる</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ポケモンセンター</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">誕生日に行くとお祝いしてもらえます！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">最初に考えた時は</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">音楽とメッセージぐらいの簡素なものを</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">イメージしてたのですが</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ゲームフリークスタッフが</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">気合いを入れてくれて</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">かなり豪華に可愛くしてくれましたよ！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9255050/002-888db720b6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9255050/002-888db720b6.webp\" alt=\"_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_128APPLE_IMG_8813.JPG\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"576\" height=\"455\"></a></figure><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">サン・ムーンはこんな感じ！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">日本は</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ハッピーバースデーの音楽ですが</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">国によってはポケモンセンターの</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">オルゴール版だったりします</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">誕生日の人には</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">生で見て欲しいので</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ゲーム内のポケモンセンター</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">誕生日には必ず</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">行ってくださいねー！！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">もちろん</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">誕生月にリアルポケモンセンターに</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">行くのもお忘れなく！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">チャオ！</div>"}}